OL,3,AChinese artist jailed over satirical
OL,4,AMao sculptures, say rights groups
OL,5,
OL,6,FGao has been in detention for the past
OL,7,Ftwo years, and the UN and many rights
OL,8,Fgroups have called for him to be
OL,9,Freleased. Amnesty International has
OL,10,Fcalled his sentencing an "assault" on
OL,11,Fartistic freedom.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
